[Desktop Entry]
Name=Fade Menu
Name[en_GB]=Fade Menu
Name[zh_CN]=菜单渐隐渐现
Icon=preferences-system-windows-effect-fademenu
Comment=Make menu smoothly fade in and out when they are shown or hidden
Comment[en_GB]=Make menu smoothly fade in and out when they are shown or hidden
Comment[zh_CN]=当菜单被显示或者隐藏时，使窗口平滑地淡入淡出

